ersation.","ids":[53125,53133],"class":"single","sources":[2,3,4,9,10]}],[{"text":"Carney confirmed the visit dates.","ids":[53158],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"On December Modi will visit Canada.","ids":[53124],"class":"established","sources":[3,9,11]}],[{"text":"The proposed Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement is expected to support efforts to double bilateral trade by 2030.","ids":[53153],"class":"unverified","sources":[9,10]}],[{"text":"The visit aims to expand cooperation in trade, energy, technology, security and people-to-people ties.","ids":[53155],"class":"unverified","sources":[4,9]}],[{"text":"Canada and India aim to conclude negotiations on a comprehensive economic partnership agreement at the earliest opportunity, and Modi and Carney are committed to concluding negotiations on a Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (CEPA), the Canadian Prime Minister's Office said.","ids":[53128,53147],"parts":[{"text":"Canada and India aim to conclude negotiations on a comprehensive economic partnership agreement at the earliest opportunity, and Modi and Carney are committed to concluding negotiations on a Comprehensive Economic Partnership Agreement (CEPA),","ids":[53128,53147],"class":"single"},{"text":"the Canadian Prime Minister's Office said.","ids":[53128],"class":"unverified"}],"class":"single","sources":[3,9,10]}],[{"text":"Modi described the conversation with Carney as warm and productive.","ids":[53126],"class":"single","sources":[3]}],[{"text":"Modi's visit to Canada will be largely in Toronto, Rt. Hon. Carney said.","ids":[53275],"class":"single","sources":[11]}],[{"text":"Modi will address a diaspora event in Toronto, an unnamed source said.","ids":[53276],"class":"single","sources":[11]}],[{"text":"Both countries are working towards finalising a trade agreement by the end of this year.","ids":[53141],"class":"unverified","sources":[2,3]}],[{"text":"Modi is expected to visit the U.S. for the G20 summit from 13 December to 15 December 2026.","ids":[53277],"class":"single","sources":[11]}],[{"text":"Modi will tour Brussels from 16 December to 17 December 2026, to sign the EU Free Trade Agreement and hold bilateral talks.","ids":[53278],"class":"single","sources":[11]}]],"section_keys":["news","background","happened","happened","happened","happened","say","say","say","say","next","next","next"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://hindi.news18.com/news/nation/pm-narendra-modi-will-visit-canada-on-december-11-and-12-as-india-canada-ties-improve-10912973.html","outlet":"News18 Hindi","title":"PM मोदी 11-12 दिसंबर को जाएंगे कनाडा, प्रधानमंत्री मार्क कार्नी ने किया तारीखों का ऐलान","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://news24online.com/india/pm-modi-to-visit-canada-on-december-11-12-as-new-delhi-and-ottawa-aim-to-rebuild-ties-and-boost-trade/943450/","outlet":"News24","title":"PM Modi to visit Canada on December 11-12 as New Delhi and Ottawa aim to rebuild ties and boost trade","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":3,"url":"https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/pm-modi-to-visit-canada-on-december-11-12-as-delhi-ottawa-push-to-boost-ties-101792113693048.html","outlet":"Hindustan Times","title":"PM Modi to visit Canada on December 11-12 as countries seek to boost ties","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":4,"url":"https://ndtv.in/world-news/pm-modi-canada-visit-december-11-12-bilateral-talks-trade-security-partnership-mark-carney-meeting-agreement-india-canada-relations-12192688","outlet":"NDTV India","title":"11-12 दिसंबर को कनाडा दौरे पर जाएंगे पीएम मोदी; व्यापार से सुरक्षा तक कई अहम मुद्दों पर PM कार्नी से होगी बात","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":5,"url":"https://www.amarujala.com/india-news/canada-trade-delegation-india-visit-bilateral-trade-cepa-talks-2026-10-11","outlet":"","title":"","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":6,"url":"https://www.dailyexcelsior.com/canada-to-send-300-member-trade-deleg